# Forbidden Patterns

Never use these; use the alternative instead.

| Pattern | Why | Alternative |
|---------|-----|-------------|
| `print(...)` for debug/trace | Non-testable side effects | pytest assertions; domain/boundary exceptions |
| Literal `34`, `136`, `16` scattered in logic | Breaks SSOT | `MagicConstant` / named constants in entity |
| `except:` or `except Exception: pass` | Swallows RED/GREEN signal | Specific catches; map to `UI_ERR_*` at boundary only |
| New `src/` behavior without failing test first | Violates Dual-Track TDD | Failing DT-* or UT-* → RED → minimal impl |
| Looser asserts, skip/xfail, changed F-OK-01 golden | False green (RG-01, RG-04) | Fix production; keep golden fixed |
| UT-* importing concrete `PartialGridSolver` | Couples contract to impl | Mock `DomainSolverPort`; use IT-* for real path |
| `entity/` importing `boundary/`, `control/`, `data/` | Breaks ECB (RG-05) | Entity-only dependencies |
| Boundary reshuffling n1,n2 or coords from domain `SolutionVector` | Violates UX-05, D-V2 | Return domain output verbatim after validation |

